WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.330
Kyoto                Nagoya / Hida Takayama / Shinshu

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.330
Hokkaido

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:04.960
Let's go on a vacation!
Together, during summer break!

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.500
And if she's not busy, I'd like Sutea to come along!

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.710
Vacation?!

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:10.460
Vacation...

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:16.040
Miss Serene?

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.830
What's the matter with her?

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:22.000
This is a work of fiction. Names, characters, organizations, laws, etc.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:22.000
are products of the author's imagination or used fictitiously.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.250
Did she shut herself in her room?

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.000
Was it because of what I said?!

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:24.920
N-no, it's a wonderful plan!

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.040
But...

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:30.130
You're up, Koushi. Good luck!

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:32.420
Gee, thanks...

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:47.380
You're just pretending not to notice, aren't you?

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:50.420
Mother of the Goddess' Dormitory

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:50.290
I can see the truth in your eyes

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:53.290
This isn't some sort of dramatic romance

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:56.920
My flushed body feels like it could melt

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:59.880
Honestly, I'm just being shy

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:02.880
Let me stir up feelings deep inside

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:05.630
I'll dress you in this outfit

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:08.580
See? My heart races for nobody but you

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:14.000
It is what it is, take it as it comes, just go with the flow

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.000
If you peer through the other side of the glass

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.420
You'll see a world of charming sweeties

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:25.880
Face to face, hold me in your arms, squeeze me tight

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:28.830
I want you so close to my side that

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:31.210
I can feel your pulse

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.540
Ooey-gooey love

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:37.830
My feelings for you get jumbled up by naughty love

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.380
Ooey-gooey love

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:44.170
Whatever you want, do as you like, I don't mind

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.880
Tracing my fingers along your skin

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:50.290
I'll show you a syrupy-sweet dream

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:52.920
When I stare at your lips

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:56.080
I wanna kiss you more and more

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:08.000
Episode 5

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:08.000
Serene the Shut-in

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.290
F-first, I need to ask her what's wrong...

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:19.670
Come to think of it, I haven't been
inside of Miss Serene's room yet.

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:23.080
I'm willing to bet that... it's not normal...

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.920
A room filled with toxic fumes
that might asphyxiate me?

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:29.420
A cosplay room with an owner
who might drag me in if I stray too close?

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:32.330
Enough! Get it together, Koushi!

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:33.920
You're the dorm mother!

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.750
I'm coming in, Miss Serene.

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.460
Miss Serene?

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:47.920
Where are you?

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:01.830
M-M-M-Miss Serene?!

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.130
My sleeping space collapsed.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:07.460
I'll have to assemble it again from scratch.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.040
Why would you sleep on top of the bookshelf... ?

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:12.670
Oh, never mind. Can you get off me, please?

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:16.750
You don't have to let the trash pile up
like this, y'know. Just say the word and I'll-

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.170
It isn't trash.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:21.710
This has been cultivated by absorbing
the power that emanates from the moon,

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:25.830
and it all serves as an essential segment
to implement lunar technology.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:30.420
Yep. I don't get it.

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:33.000
Wait a minute... "Lunar something-or-another"...

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:39.210
If you, too, agree to become Serene's servant,
I can repair the floor using lunar technology.

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:41.040
Miss Serene!

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:45.420
The night I slept in Miss Kiriya's room,
did you come to visit me?

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:49.290
I paid some lip service...

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.790
The fact that she doesn't deny it must mean...

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.830
that wasn't a dream.

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:59.580
Are you here about the vacation?

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.000
O-oh yeah! What's wrong?

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:05.290
I overheard Atena expressing her interest.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:07.630
I'm not necessarily opposed to a vacation.

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:08.460
Then...!

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:10.290
However...

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:15.290
Ordinarily, my activities are limited to
the dormitory and the college campus.

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:18.920
I have never set foot outside of that area,
so there is a sense of unease...

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.580
What?! Only the school and the dorm?!

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:25.080
The moon's power abounds in this vicinity.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.080
It brings peace of mind.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:30.380
B-but you aren't opposed to
the vacation itself, right?

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:33.630
I see...

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.500
Okay. I get the picture.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.960
Well then, how does this sound?

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:46.420
Let's find some potential "segments,"
as Serene calls them, and give them to her as gifts.

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:51.040
In other words, we'll be creating a portable "safe zone"
that she can carry with her even on our trip.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.710
That's a great idea!

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:55.080
But these "segments"...

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:56.960
What kind of stuff are we looking for?

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.540
Something from the moon, I assume.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:01.460
That's a pretty tall order.

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:05.460
You know, Serene's actually been
living here longer than all of us.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:10.960
Now that you mention it, we've been content to just
let the mystery behind Serene remain a mystery.

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:14.790
Then, for the time being, how about we all
look for objects that remind us of the moon?

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:15.790
'Kay.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:20.380
Segment... The moon's power...

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.380
Hmm, this is hard...

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:26.250
Sutea?

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:28.710
Sutea!

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:31.920
Hey, listen. During the summer, Miss Atena-

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:40.750
Oh, that's right. It's already that time of year.

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:44.710
What did you say... about the summer?

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:48.500
Cold!

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:50.830
Let's chat when we get to school!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:53.080
A vacation?

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.880
Yeah. And Miss Atena wants you to come.

00:05:57.630 --> 00:05:58.630
I'll go.

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:00.290
R-really?

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:01.540
To supervise...

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.630
Somebody has to keep an eye on you!

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.210
Huh?!

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.130
I won't tolerate any bad behavior!

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:08.830
Ow-ow-ow-ow-ow!

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:11.250
SUTEA!

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:14.460
Serene

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:16.500
My servant is under attack...

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:18.210
Serene!

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:27.460
This is a costume from an anime called
"Lunar Valkyrie Moonlight."

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:30.210
What do you think?
Why don't you try wearing this outside?!

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:36.000
"In the name of the moon, you will look fabulous!"

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:44.920
Earth manual, page 5360:

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:48.330
"The unauthorized donning of cosplay
in a public setting is a breach of etiquette."

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:53.880
I-I suppose you're absolutely right...

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:57.210
It's back to square one...

00:06:58.420 --> 00:07:00.250
Let me take a stab at it.

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:01.460
Mineru?

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:05.580
Using my knowledge and expertise,
I sped up the aging process.

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:10.000
With my patented Moonlight Sake,
we'll lure Serene out of there in no time!

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:15.630
Once she gets a whiff of this,
no woman has the power to resist...!

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.000
Uh-oh...

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.080
Mineru!

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:31.080
Let's get you changed, shall we?

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:33.420
N-now, hold on...

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:34.710
Uh...

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:37.710
Wait, wait...!

00:07:37.710 --> 00:07:39.460
NOOO!

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:51.290
I'm back.

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.210
What are you doing?

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.290
Oh, welcome home.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.290
This is called "Tai Chi."

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:58.710
"Tai Chi"?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.540
Yup. It's a type of Chinese martial art
that incorporates the concept of "taiji,"

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:04.630
which relates to the vastness of the universe.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:09.000
And since the moon is a part of the universe,
practicing it might help Serene get the power to-

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.250
Serene!

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:12.000
Miss Serene!

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.000
What happened?

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.460
Are you okay?!

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:17.920
If you recall, my connection is only with the moon.

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:22.290
The power of the universe has proven
too much for me to handle.

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:24.330
R-really...?

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:25.330
I'm sorry.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:27.960
Not at all. I am simply inexperienced.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.830
U-um, I-!

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:31.830
Hey, guys!

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:32.830
Don't forget about me!

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:35.130
Citizens of the moonlight!

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:36.330
Miss Frey!

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:39.710
Come with us, and step into the future!

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.080
Um, Miss Mineru, what are you...?

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.580
Don't ask, kiddo.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.380
Do not fret.
This isn't technically a public setting.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.210
For real?

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.750
What are you all doing out here?

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.580
Welcome home, Miss Atena.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:53.710
We're... trying to come up with something
related to the "segments," but...

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:56.330
Are we done playing dress-up now, Frey?
We're... trying to come up with something
related to the "segments," but...

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:57.750
Nope!

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.330
Oh! Well, in that case...

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:01.630
Here you go!

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.710
An umbrella...

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:05.460
Try opening it up.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:18.290
Oh, wow! It's got a pattern on the inside.

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:19.540
How unique.

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.830
Wh-what do you think?

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:24.330
If you use that, can you go on vacation
with the rest of us?

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.790
Thank goodness!

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:31.790
I booked the most beautiful hotel
with an ocean view!

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.880
Ooh, fancy!

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.670
I'll have to pack my swimsuit!

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.290
I can hardly wait!

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:40.040
Thanks for dinner!

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:46.920
Miss Serene!

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:51.880
I'm sorry, I did the laundry
but hadn't given this back yet.

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:54.290
When I looked closely,
I noticed there were some holes in it,

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:56.080
so I went ahead and patched it up.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:10:00.290
I'm still not sure whether it has
anything to do with the moon...

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:03.330
But as far as peace of mind goes,
you're always wearing it.

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.830
So I figured it might make you
feel the most comfortable.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.880
Please forgive me if I overstepped my bounds.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.830
Plus, you have Miss Atena's umbrella now...

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:14.000
I was concerned about the frayed stitches.

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:17.080
That contributed to my sense of unease.

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:18.080
Probably.

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:19.750
Thank you.

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:23.330
These holy robes are sacred.

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:24.580
I'm very happy.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:31.330
Miss Serene really is a mysterious person...

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:43.960
It's impressive he could mend the holy robes.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:50.210
My judgement was accurate, after all.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.750
The time is nearly upon us.

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:01.540
You're awake.

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:02.250
Huh?

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:04.710
What?! Did I fell asleep?

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:05.960
I'm sorry.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:08.750
We'll be arriving at the inn shortly.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.920
There's the beach!

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.250
And a mountain...

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:21.670
Suisei Manor

00:11:21.670 --> 00:11:22.330
Suisei Manor

00:11:21.670 --> 00:11:22.330
The Goddess Dormitory Goes on Vacation

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:26.500
The Goddess Dormitory Goes on Vacation

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:30.790
I'm positive I booked the trendiest
destination of the summer,

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:33.540
a classy seaside hotel called the "Suisei Inn."

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.170
Reservation for:

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.170
Suisei Manor

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:35.170
This is "Suisei Manor"...

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:40.170
Suisei Manor

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:39.130
I must've booked the wrong one
because the names were so similar!

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.170
Oh...

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.960
I-i-if we leave now, we could still go to the bea-

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:44.750
Welcome!

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:49.210
We've been expecting you!

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:53.580
Th-thank you for having us.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:04.130
Cool and quiet.

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:05.790
The perfect way to beat the summer heat, right?

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:08.670
So don't be so down on yourself, Atena!

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:11.380
Oh dear...

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:14.290
Hoo boy. This looks to be serious.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.830
Do you feel that nice breeze, Miss Atena?

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:19.290
Look, they even have a little shrine!

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:23.380
Wow, isn't this great? The aura, I mean.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:26.210
It's gotta be one of those energy hot spots.

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:29.500
I'm sensing something a bit different...

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.880
I've never seen talismans like that before.

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:35.460
If I had to guess, I'd say that this place is haunted.

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:40.210
Now that you mention it,
I got that kind of vibe from the inn, too.

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:43.000
Apparently, they even have an abandoned annex.

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:44.880
You gonna be okay, Sutea?

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:46.750
Yeah, I like ghost stuff.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.290
Then tonight, let's-

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:50.000
Oh? What's the matter, Kiriya?

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:51.750
N-n-n-nothing!

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:53.420
Are you scared, Kiriya?

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:59.210
A-are you okay, Miss Kiriya?!

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:02.540
Sutea?!

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.580
The wind is messing up my hair.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:06.540
Whoa, it's Medusa the Snake Lady!

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:10.790
Ow, ow! Cut it out, Sutea! Ouch!

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:13.210
I guess the wind caught wind of
your immoral behavior!

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.790
Aw, that's my line...

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:22.750
Well the rest of this place might have
a super creepy vibe,

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:24.920
but these baths are to die for!

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:26.630
And the view is exquisite.

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:30.040
Atena, you managed to
redeem yourself in one fell swoop.

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:31.710
You did good, kid.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:35.000
After having such a nice bath and a tasty dinner,

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.170
maybe even Kiriya will-

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:37.580
You called?!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.040
Kiriya, is that...?

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.540
Are you, by any chance, afraid of gho-

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.790
GHOSTS

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.790
BE GONE

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:45.040
I-I-I-I'm not afraid, okay?!

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:47.380
I'd like to see a ghost at least once.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:50.750
N-n-n-not seeing one is
totally cool though, right? Yup!

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:53.380
Atena, can I ask you something?

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:54.380
Sure.

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:57.130
What made you think of going on a vacation?

00:13:57.130 --> 00:14:01.580
I also thought it'd be fun to take a trip somewhere
with everyone during the summer, but...

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:04.420
you're the last person I expected to organize it.

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:09.420
W-well, I wanted a chance to spend some
quality time with you guys, of course.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:13.880
But I also wanted to make up for
Sutea's last visit to the dorm.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:16.830
And...

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.790
Koushi! How's the men's bath?

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:27.210
Oh, i-it's very nice!

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:28.290
You alone?

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:29.710
Y-yes?

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:32.210
What are you doing?!

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:33.420
Peeping!

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.710
Where there's an open-air bath,
there's gotta be some peeping!

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:37.830
And you weren't peeping at us...

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:39.250
Of course I wasn't!

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:41.080
So we had to peep first.

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:43.710
You can't do that!

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:46.710
Don't worry, I'm wearing a towel.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:48.580
That's not the issue here!

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:51.460
I'm sorry. You must be lonely all by yourself...

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:53.960
How about we all sleep in the same room tonight?

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:55.080
No way!

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:56.750
Aw, don't be like that.

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:57.880
Whoops!

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.580
Mr. Fuki Mamoru!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.330
You brought 'em with you, eh?

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:05.540
Of course I did!

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:07.290
Please don't mess with Koushi like that!

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:08.460
Take this!

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:15.170
Koushi!

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:18.000
Oh my! He beat you to it this time.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:20.290
KOUSHI!

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:24.500
I told them no, and yet here we are...

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:27.920
Why is everyone sleeping in my room?!

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:35.460
How am I supposed to sleep like this...?

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.290
Miss Atena...?

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:41.330
Bathroom, maybe?

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.290
Did she have another nosebleed?!

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:45.380
'Cause she slept in the same room as me?!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:47.540
C'mere, little body pillow...

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:49.630
No running away, 'kay?

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:57.130
I finally escaped...

00:15:57.460 --> 00:16:00.170
Miss Atena sure is taking a long time.

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:02.580
Maybe she didn't go to the bathroom...

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:05.080
Yup, it's a mystery alright!

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:07.830
What are you doing?!

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.290
Ah, my bad, kiddo.

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:12.080
But I was starting to get concerned about Atena.

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:15.540
I mean, what if she got caught up
in some sort of paranormal phenomenon?!

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:16.790
Nah, no way!

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.080
The theme for my summer research is

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:24.130
"A Theoretical Demonstration of Phenomena
Related to the Paranormal, Etcetera."

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:25.460
"Etcetera"...?

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:28.750
To put it simply, stuff like
the Suspension Bridge Effect.

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:34.380
Oh, that's the one where people experience fear
and then mistake it for falling in love with each other...

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.630
And you're looking for "paranormal phenomena"?

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:38.580
Etcetera, etcetera.

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.630
Did you find her?

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:47.920
She wasn't in the bath or the washroom.

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:49.750
Where could she have gone?

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:52.290
There's only one area we haven't checked yet...

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:58.130
The Annex is

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:58.130
Currently Closed

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:55.500
Should we take a quick peek?

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:57.420
Y-yeah, let's go.

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:02.250
This annex is a whole lot bigger than I imagined.

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:05.130
Yeah. A little too big.

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:07.170
It almost feels like it's...

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.790
getting bigger or something...

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:17.080
Could this be the result of a gap in visual stimuli
and our perception of time and space...?

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:21.080
Or is the space undergoing
a rapid physical expansion...?

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:25.500
Miss Mineru...

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:31.460
Seriously?

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:42.670
Sorry about that.

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:44.420
Didn't mean to take off without you.

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:48.420
Should we hold hands?
There's something strange about this place...

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:49.880
S-sure.

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:57.460
Miss Mineru might be free-spirited,
but she's also pretty dependable.

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:59.710
She's always there for me when it counts.

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:01.710
But that's exactly why...

00:18:02.130 --> 00:18:04.000
You are scared, aren't you?

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:05.920
Huh? Scared of what?

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:08.540
This weird hallway, maybe. Or of ghosts...

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:11.330
I figured that you must be scared too, Miss Mineru.

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:13.670
Hmm. Well, maybe a little...

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:16.080
I promise to keep you safe!

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:19.580
As your big sister, I'm the one
who should be saying that.

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:21.960
But I'm the dorm mother.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.710
We're on vacation right now.

00:18:24.710 --> 00:18:26.580
This isn't the dorm.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.710
There's no need for that here.

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:35.460
Besides, I'll admit that I was scared,
but I'm fine when I'm with everyone else.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:38.080
And right now, I've got you, Koushi...

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:45.540
Is this the Suspension Bridge Effect?!

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:49.040
I-I'm gonna go wash my face!

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:55.540
That was close...

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:00.040
Koushi! Why are all of the lights off?!

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:02.540
Miss Atena! Where on earth have you been...?

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:05.250
I was looking for the bathroom, but...

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:07.670
Where are we?

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:11.500
A gap in visual stimuli and
our perception of time and space...?

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.670
Don't think about it too hard!

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:16.170
Are you by yourself?

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:19.040
Oh, actually, Miss Mineru is right behind me.

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:22.170
Or not!

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:23.000
Huh?!

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:26.460
This way!

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:30.130
Miss Atena!

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:31.000
Shh!

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:34.670
I thought it was spooky,
but I didn't think it was actually haunted...!

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:37.250
It's okay. It's going to be okay.

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:42.460
Miss Atena, what about your nosebleeds?

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:45.540
I'm doing my best to endure, so don't remind me.

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:51.330
A-at the start of the day, you saw a lame side of me,
but I'm going to do better now.

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.630
Do better...?

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:57.330
You're always trying your hardest. For our sake.

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.040
But, y'see...

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.710
that's why...

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:05.580
What exactly am I? What am I to Koushi?

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:07.330
Are we dorm mother and resident?

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:09.000
Big sister and little brother?

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:10.540
Or...?

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:12.920
Nah, it doesn't matter.

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:14.420
Miss Atena...?

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:16.830
At least for this trip, he is...

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:20.040
At least for this trip, I am...

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:22.250
I'll protect you.

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:24.170
Huh?

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:27.830
I'm going to keep you safe this time, Koushi.

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.630
Miss Atena...

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.170
Wh-what is this feeling...?

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:35.960
What the heck is wrong with me...?

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:41.880
Goodness me, Atena is assaulting Koushi!

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:44.920
N-n-n-no, I...!

00:20:45.630 --> 00:20:47.540
Poltergeist attack!

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:49.380
Oh dear.

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:51.080
Just a misunderstanding.

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:56.290
Oh... so that was Miss Serene.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:58.540
I wonder if she got worried and came looking for us...

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:01.040
Serene, aren't you wearing your yukata inside-out?

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:05.460
Please get me out!

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:09.380
We hope to see you soon!

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:12.830
What?!

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:14.460
So I missed all the fun?!

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.830
Good thing I'm a heavy sleeper...

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:19.670
That's no fair, you guys!

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:22.170
I'm sorry about last night, Miss Serene.

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:24.790
I thought you were a ghost,
so I ran off and left you behind...

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:26.420
It's alright.

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:29.830
The manner in which I
conducted myself was misleading.

00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:34.630
Last night, it became clear that a spatial distortion
had developed inside the building.

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:36.580
So I had gone to investigate.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:39.380
The cause was a transformation
of high density particles

00:21:39.380 --> 00:21:42.000
originating from the Moon's position
in conjunction with the Earth.

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.130
I'm not so sure about this "moon" stuff...

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:46.250
But Miss Serene seems to be enjoying herself.

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:48.790
I'm glad we were able to get her out of the dorm.

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.880
I made a whole bunch of mistakes, but...

00:21:55.880 --> 00:22:00.420
At the end of the day, I hope I was able
to show that he can rely on me...

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:01.880
As his big sister.

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:06.830
As his... big sister...?

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:09.380
H-hey, Atena-

00:22:09.380 --> 00:22:11.210
Your attention, please!

00:22:12.170 --> 00:22:15.210
Frey is apparently not yet fully satisfied
with our vacation, so...

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:16.670
Today's the day!

00:22:17.080 --> 00:22:18.920
The beach!

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:26.630
It's gotta be you

00:22:26.750 --> 00:22:28.380
It's gotta be you

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:29.960
It's gotta be you

00:22:29.960 --> 00:22:32.130
I'm sure of it, but...

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:33.790
I can't admit it

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:35.580
I'll never admit it

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:37.170
And the truth is

00:22:37.170 --> 00:22:39.330
I wanna tell you

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:42.420
You're still just like a child

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:46.040
Blind to everything around you

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:49.330
Those nonchalant actions of yours

00:22:49.330 --> 00:22:52.790
Make my heart skip a beat

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:55.790
Why do I think

00:22:55.790 --> 00:22:57.580
Of someone like her

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:59.420
As a rival?

00:22:59.420 --> 00:23:01.080
It's bizzare

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:03.670
The longer that I live with you

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:09.500
The more that everyone seems to change

00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:13.170
Hey! I love your bashful side

00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:14.960
And your serious side, too

00:23:14.960 --> 00:23:18.250
I always, always want you by my side

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:20.290
Aah! This position that I'm in

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:21.960
I don't wanna give it up

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:23.750
I wanna profess my love!

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:27.080
Our hectic daily life together

00:23:27.290 --> 00:23:30.080
I wish it could go on forever

00:23:30.080 --> 00:23:30.670
It's like

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:31.290
When you're here

00:23:31.420 --> 00:23:32.040
When you're here

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:32.790
Next to me

00:23:32.790 --> 00:23:34.630
I can't help but blush

00:23:34.630 --> 00:23:35.880
It's gotta be you

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:37.540
It's gotta be you

00:23:37.670 --> 00:23:39.290
It's gotta be you

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:41.460
I'm sure of it, but...

00:23:41.460 --> 00:23:43.080
I can't admit it

00:23:43.080 --> 00:23:44.880
I'll never admit it

00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:46.460
And the truth is

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:50.040
I wanna tell you, but...

00:23:52.460 --> 00:23:55.170
Cosplay is a transformation of
the body and the mind.

00:23:55.170 --> 00:23:57.210
You must cast everything else aside, Koushi!

00:23:57.210 --> 00:23:58.960
Can I at least skip the girly underwear?

00:23:58.960 --> 00:24:01.210
But it's got cute frills and ribbons on it!

00:24:01.210 --> 00:24:04.880
Yes, but... Still, a man's gotta
draw the line at panties!

00:24:04.880 --> 00:24:06.670
Then a bra is fair game, right?

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:11.040
Sutea Ponders About the Sea

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:11.040
Koushi Makes His Cosplay Debut

00:24:07.080 --> 00:24:09.830
That's taking emasculation to a whole other level!
